<script setup>
defineProps({evidence:Object,snapshot:Boolean,checking:Boolean,snapshotDescription:String})
defineEmits(['retry'])
const status={available:'已获取',unavailable:'暂不可用',disabled:'未启用',out_of_range:'超出预报范围',empty:'未找到候选'}
const category={cafe:'咖啡馆',restaurant:'餐厅',park:'公园',museum:'博物馆'}
</script>
<template><section v-if="evidence" class="panel evidence-panel"><h2>规划依据</h2><p class="badge">{{snapshot?'已保存方案的历史依据':'本次查询结果'}}</p><p v-if="snapshot" class="muted">{{snapshotDescription || '这是生成此版本时保存的快照。点击左侧“查询天气与地点依据”可查看当前结果；旧快照不会被覆盖。'}}</p><p class="muted">查询于 {{new Date(evidence.fetchedAt).toLocaleString()}}</p><p v-if="evidence.location">定位：<a :href="evidence.location.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{evidence.location.name}}</a>（{{evidence.location.timezone}}）</p><h3>天气预报 · {{status[evidence.weatherStatus]}}</h3><p v-if="evidence.weather">{{evidence.weather.date}} · {{evidence.weather.description}} · {{evidence.weather.minC}}–{{evidence.weather.maxC}} ℃<span v-if="evidence.weather.rainProbability!==null"> · 最大降水概率 {{evidence.weather.rainProbability}}%</span> · <a :href="evidence.weather.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open-Meteo 原始数据</a></p><div v-if="!snapshot && evidence.weatherStatus==='unavailable'" role="status"><p>本次天气查询未成功，失败结果不缓存，可以重新查询。</p><button type="button" class="secondary" :disabled="checking" @click="$emit('retry')">{{checking?'正在查询…':'重新查询天气与地点'}}</button></div><h3>候选地点 · {{status[evidence.placesStatus]}}</h3><p class="muted">定位点周边约 3 公里；不代表从你当前位置出发的距离，也未计算路线。</p><details v-if="evidence.places.length"><summary>查看 {{evidence.places.length}} 个地点及来源</summary><article class="result" v-for="p in evidence.places" :key="p.id"><a :href="p.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{p.name}}</a> · {{category[p.category]||p.category}}<p>{{p.address||'来源未提供完整地址'}}</p><p class="muted">地图记录营业时间：{{p.openingHours||'未提供'}}（可能过时，出行前确认）</p></article></details><ul><li v-for="note in evidence.notices" :key="note">{{note}}</li></ul><p class="muted">天气：Open-Meteo<span v-if="evidence.places.some(p=>p.id.startsWith('amap/'))"> · 地点：高德地图（GCJ-02）</span><span v-else-if="evidence.places.length"> · 地点：<a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">© OpenStreetMap contributors</a>（WGS84）</span></p></section></template>
<style scoped>.evidence-panel{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.evidence-panel h3{margin-top:18px}.evidence-panel a{color:#166d68}.evidence-panel li{margin:8px 0}</style>
